From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CBOC-Vita <344212538+CBOC-Vita@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:10:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 75/76] gl: a resolution rung at the end of Auto, and cull
 statistics in ge_replay

After FXAA is off, Auto can drop the 3D scene to 85% of the display size
(pre-allocated twin target, enlarged before the HUD) and recover after
headroom, with the same hysteresis and back-off. gl_scene_scale=0 disables it.
ge_replay --cull-stats counts the triangles submitted with culling on.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
