 //     so a scene the GPU cannot afford is tried a few times a minute at most; a try that lasts `settle_us` (60 s) forgives it.
 //   * The first `grace_frames` 3D frames after FXAA comes on are not counted: the pass makes its target the first time.
+//   * A last rung (`scale_rung`, off unless the renderer turns it on): with FXAA already off, `late_frames_off` more late 3D frames
